abstract: >-
  A theory-based module on managing geospatial research data during a project:
  the research data lifecycle and data management plans, vector and raster
  data models, geospatial file formats, coordinate reference systems,
  designing data with data dictionaries, organizing, versioning and backing up
  files, and assessing data quality.
